      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "LinkedIn Events",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-events",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The identity of the resourceName is events . Currently, this resource captures all LinkedIn events created by regulated members. This also includes LinkedIn events created by a regulated member on behalf of a Company Page. The methods available are: CREATE.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "LinkedIn Event activity schema",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-event-activity-schema",
      "SectionPath": [
        "LinkedIn Event activity schema"
      ],
      "Text": "Following is the schema for the activity field of the Compliance Events created for LinkedIn Events. This activity is processed and additional contextual information is added and stored as the processedActivity field in the compliance event.",
